  description: '2 Level 9 monsters

    Once per turn, you can also Xyz Summon "Galaxy-Eyes
    Antimatter Dragon" by using an Xyz Monster you control with 3 or more materials
    (transfer its materials). Any battle damage this card with material inflicts
    to your opponent is halved. You can detach 1 material from this card; this card
    gains the ability this turn to make up to 2 attacks on monsters during each Battle
    Phase, then if the detached material was a monster, you can send 1 monster with
    its same Type from your Deck to the GY.'
